<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34206" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pausănĭas</span></b> , ae,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παυσανίας</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Son of Cleombrotus</i>, <i>the leader
				of the Spartans in the battle of Platœa</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Off.
				1, 22, 76</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Nep.
				Vit. Paus. 1</span></i> sqq.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A prince of Pherœ</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 36,
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A prœtor of the Epirotes</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 32,
			10</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>A Macedonian</i>, <i>the murderer of
				Philip</i>, <i><span class="en">Just. 9, 6, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 1 al.</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
